#HELPS
1 ABINABI SIXTH HOUSE BASE~
Abinabi is a blighted cavern in the northwestern Ashlands, west of Falasmaryon
where Sixth House cultists and warped creatures gather around a hidden shrine.
Dreamers keep watch among ash statues, corprus hunks and soot-blackened altars
as a heavy bell hammer rests within the corrupted depths.~
